---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/drain-cleaning.css';
---

<Layout
  title="Drain Cleaning in Central Ohio | Hesson Plumbing & Drains"
  description="Professional drain cleaning in Groveport, Columbus & Central Ohio. Same-day service, hydro-jetting, camera inspections, main line clearing. Family owned. Call (740) 304-4195."
  canonicalPath="/drain-cleaning"
>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="dc-hero">
    <div class="dc-hero__photo"></div>
    <div class="dc-hero__noise"></div>
    <div class="dc-hero__glow"></div>
    <div class="dc-hero__glow dc-hero__glow--left"></div>

    <div class="container dc-hero__inner">

      <div class="dc-hero__headline">
        <h1>Drain<br /><span class="dc-hero__outlined">Cleaning</span></h1>
        <p class="dc-hero__sub">Same-day service across Central Ohio. We find the clog, clear it, and make sure it doesn't come back.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="dc-hero__cta-row">
        <a href="tel:7403044195" class="btn-primary dc-hero__btn">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07A19.5 19.5 0 0 1 4.69 13.1a19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 3.6 2.22h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L7.91 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6.06 6.06l.93-.93a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 21.72 17z"/></svg>
          Call Now
        </a>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-ghost">Request Service</a>
        <div class="dc-hero__trust">
          <span>&#10003; Same-Day Available</span>
          <span>&#10003; Family Owned</span>
          <span>&#10003; Central Ohio</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="dc-hero__cards">
        <div class="dc-hero__card dc-hero__card--years">
          <span class="dc-hero__card-num">25+</span>
          <span class="dc-hero__card-label">Years<br />Experience</span>
        </div>
        <div class="dc-hero__card dc-hero__card--emergency">
          <div class="dc-hero__card-dot"></div>
          <p class="dc-hero__card-title">Emergency Line</p>
          <a href="tel:7403044195" class="dc-hero__card-phone">(740) 304-4195</a>
        </div>
        <div class="dc-hero__card dc-hero__card--available">
          <span class="dc-hero__card-big">24/7</span>
          <span class="dc-hero__card-small">Available Now</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- INTRO -->
  <section class="dc-intro">
    <div class="container dc-intro__inner">
      <div class="dc-intro__text reveal-left">
        <p class="eyebrow">Central Ohio's Drain Experts</p>
        <h2>Fast. Clean.<br /><span class="dc-blue">Done Right.</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="dc-intro__body reveal-right">
        <p>At Hesson Plumbing &amp; Drains, drain cleaning is one of our most requested services and one we take seriously. Whether you're dealing with a slow kitchen sink, a backed-up shower, or a full main line blockage, we show up fast, diagnose the problem accurately, and clear it completely. With over 25 years serving Central Ohio, we've seen every type of clog and have the tools to handle all of them including our state-of-the-art hydro-jetting machine that restores your pipes to like-new condition without digging or reconstruction.</p>
        <div class="dc-intro__stats">
          <div class="dc-intro__stat">
            <span class="dc-intro__stat-num">25+</span>
            <span class="dc-intro__stat-label">Years Experience</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dc-intro__stat">
            <span class="dc-intro__stat-num">24/7</span>
            <span class="dc-intro__stat-label">Emergency Service</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dc-intro__stat">
            <span class="dc-intro__stat-num">Same</span>
            <span class="dc-intro__stat-label">Day Available</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SIGNS YOU NEED IT -->
  <section class="dc-signs">
    <video autoplay muted loop playsinline class="dc-signs__video">
      <source src="/drain-1.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
    </video>
    <div class="dc-signs__overlay"></div>
    <div class="container dc-signs__inner">
      <div class="dc-signs__header reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">Know the Signs</p>
        <h2>Does Your Drain<br /><span class="dc-blue">Need Attention?</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="dc-signs__grid">

        <div class="dc-sign-card reveal">
          <div class="dc-sign-card__icon">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Slow Draining</h3>
          <p>Water pooling in your sink, tub, or shower and taking forever to drain is a sure sign of a building blockage.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="dc-sign-card reveal delay-1">
          <div class="dc-sign-card__icon">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 18v-6a9 9 0 0 1 18 0v6"/><path d="M21 19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-1a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3zM3 19a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h1a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-3a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H3z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Gurgling Sounds</h3>
          <p>Unusual gurgling from your drains or toilets means trapped air — a sign of a partial blockage deeper in the pipe.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="dc-sign-card reveal delay-2">
          <div class="dc-sign-card__icon">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Recurring Clogs</h3>
          <p>If the same drain keeps clogging, the real problem isn't at the surface. It's further down the line.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="dc-sign-card reveal">
          <div class="dc-sign-card__icon">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M2 12s3-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3 7-10 7-10-7-10-7z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Foul Odors</h3>
          <p>Unpleasant smells coming from your drains are caused by organic buildup rotting inside the pipe.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="dc-sign-card reveal delay-1">
          <div class="dc-sign-card__icon">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="17 1 21 5 17 9"/><path d="M3 11V9a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h14"/><polyline points="7 23 3 19 7 15"/><path d="M21 13v2a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H3"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Multiple Slow Drains</h3>
          <p>When more than one drain is slow at the same time, you likely have a blockage in the main line.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="dc-sign-card reveal delay-2">
          <div class="dc-sign-card__icon">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 14.66V20a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h5.34"/><polygon points="18 2 22 6 12 16 8 16 8 12 18 2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Water Backing Up</h3>
          <p>Water backing up into a sink, tub, or toilet when you use another fixture is a serious main line warning sign.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SERVICES GRID -->
  <section class="dc-svc">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="dc-svc__header reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">Our Drain Services</p>
        <h2>What We<br /><span class="dc-blue">Take Care Of</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="dc-svc__grid">

        <div class="dc-svc-card reveal">
          <div class="dc-svc-card__num">01</div>
          <h3>Drain Clearing</h3>
          <p>We locate and remove blockages from kitchen sinks, bathroom drains, tubs, and showers. Fast, clean, and done right the first time.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Kitchen &amp; bathroom drains</li>
            <li>Tub &amp; shower clearing</li>
            <li>Floor drains</li>
            <li>Same-day service available</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="dc-svc-card__cta">Request Service &rarr;</a>
        </div>

        <div class="dc-svc-card reveal delay-1">
          <div class="dc-svc-card__num">02</div>
          <h3>Camera Inspection</h3>
          <p>Not sure what's causing the problem? We run a camera through your pipes to see exactly what's happening. No guessing, no unnecessary work.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Video pipe inspection</li>
            <li>Root intrusion detection</li>
            <li>Accurate diagnosis</li>
            <li>Full sewer &amp; drain lines</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="dc-svc-card__cta">Request Service &rarr;</a>
        </div>

        <div class="dc-svc-card reveal">
          <div class="dc-svc-card__num">03</div>
          <h3>Hydro Jetting</h3>
          <p>High-pressure water jetting blasts through the toughest clogs, grease, scale, and roots. Restores your pipes to like-new condition without digging.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>High-pressure water cleaning</li>
            <li>Removes grease, scale &amp; roots</li>
            <li>Restores full pipe flow</li>
            <li>No digging or reconstruction</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="dc-svc-card__cta">Request Service &rarr;</a>
        </div>

        <div class="dc-svc-card reveal delay-1">
          <div class="dc-svc-card__num">04</div>
          <h3>Main Line Clearing</h3>
          <p>When multiple drains are affected, the issue is usually in the main sewer line. We diagnose and clear main line blockages quickly to restore full function.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Main sewer line diagnosis</li>
            <li>Full blockage removal</li>
            <li>Camera verification after clearing</li>
            <li>Residential &amp; commercial</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="dc-svc-card__cta">Request Service &rarr;</a>
        </div>

        <div class="dc-svc-card reveal">
          <div class="dc-svc-card__num">05</div>
          <h3>Foundation Drain</h3>
          <p>Protect your basement from water intrusion with proper foundation drain installation. We assess, install, and verify the system works before we leave.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Site assessment</li>
            <li>Drain system installation</li>
            <li>Waterproofing integration</li>
            <li>Final flow verification</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="dc-svc-card__cta">Request Service &rarr;</a>
        </div>

        <div class="dc-svc-card reveal delay-1">
          <div class="dc-svc-card__num">06</div>
          <h3>Preventative Cleaning</h3>
          <p>Regular drain maintenance prevents emergency calls. We offer routine cleaning to keep your pipes clear and catch problems before they become expensive.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Scheduled maintenance plans</li>
            <li>Grease buildup removal</li>
            <li>Early problem detection</li>
            <li>Residential &amp; commercial</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="dc-svc-card__cta">Request Service &rarr;</a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- HYDRO JETTING FEATURE -->
  <section class="dc-hydro">
    <div class="dc-hydro__bg"></div>
    <div class="dc-hydro__overlay"></div>
    <div class="container dc-hydro__inner">
      <div class="dc-hydro__text reveal-left">
        <p class="eyebrow">Signature Service</p>
        <h2>State-of-the-Art<br /><span class="dc-blue">Hydro-Jetting</span></h2>
        <p>If a sewer inspection reveals a blockage or heavy buildup in your drains, we recommend cleaning with our hydro-jetting machine. High-pressure water jets blast away any debris inside your sewer lines, restoring your drain and sewer pipes to like-new condition. No damage, no digging, no reconstruction.</p>
        <p>This is the most thorough drain cleaning method available, and it's one of the things that sets Hesson Plumbing apart. We've used it on everything from neighborhood municipal drains to residential main lines with stubborn root intrusion.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Schedule Hydro-Jetting &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="dc-hydro__features reveal-right">
        <div class="dc-hydro-feat">
          <div class="dc-hydro-feat__num">01</div>
          <div>
            <h3>No Digging Required</h3>
            <p>The entire process is done through your existing access points. No excavation, no landscape damage, no reconstruction.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="dc-hydro-feat">
          <div class="dc-hydro-feat__num">02</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Like-New Pipe Condition</h3>
            <p>High-pressure water scours the inside of your pipes clean, removing grease, scale, mineral buildup, and root intrusion completely.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="dc-hydro-feat">
          <div class="dc-hydro-feat__num">03</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Safe for All Pipe Types</h3>
            <p>Properly calibrated pressure means no damage to your pipes. We adjust our approach based on your pipe material and condition.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="dc-hydro-feat">
          <div class="dc-hydro-feat__num">04</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Long-Lasting Results</h3>
            <p>Unlike snaking which pokes a hole through a clog, hydro-jetting removes the entire blockage and buildup for longer-lasting results.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PROCESS -->
  <section class="dc-process">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="dc-process__header reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">How It Works</p>
        <h2>Our Process</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="dc-process__steps">

        <div class="dc-process__step reveal delay-1">
          <div class="dc-process__num">1</div>
          <div class="dc-process__content">
            <h3>You Call. We Respond.</h3>
            <p>Call (740) 304-4195 or fill out our contact form. We confirm your appointment fast, often same day.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="dc-process__arrow reveal">&rarr;</div>

        <div class="dc-process__step reveal delay-2">
          <div class="dc-process__num">2</div>
          <div class="dc-process__content">
            <h3>We Diagnose.</h3>
            <p>We inspect your drain, identify the cause, and walk you through what needs to be done.<br />No surprises on the bill.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="dc-process__arrow reveal">&rarr;</div>

        <div class="dc-process__step reveal delay-3">
          <div class="dc-process__num">3</div>
          <div class="dc-process__content">
            <h3>We Clear It.</h3>
            <p>Using the right tool for the job, snake, camera, or hydro-jetter, we clear the blockage completely and verify the drain flows properly.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="dc-process__arrow reveal">&rarr;</div>

        <div class="dc-process__step reveal delay-4">
          <div class="dc-process__num">4</div>
          <div class="dc-process__content">
            <h3>You're Done.</h3>
            <p>Clean work, no mess left behind. We leave your home exactly as we found it, except your drains actually work now.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHY HESSON SPLIT -->
  <section class="dc-why">
    <div class="dc-why__photo">
      <img src="/hydro-jetter-2.jpg" alt="Hesson Plumbing hydro-jetting service in Central Ohio" />
      <div class="dc-why__placeholder" style="display:none">
        <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="rgba(117,180,218,0.3)" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1.5"/><polyline points="21 15 16 10 5 21"/></svg>
        <p>Photo Placeholder</p>
        <span>Drop a team or job site photo in /public/ and update the src above</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="dc-why__content reveal-right">
      <p class="eyebrow">Why Hesson</p>
      <h2>We Show Up.<br /><span class="dc-blue">We Get It Done.</span></h2>
      <p>We're not a big franchise with a call center. When you call Hesson Plumbing &amp; Drains, you get a local team that knows Central Ohio, shows up on time, and takes pride in the work. No runaround, no upselling, no surprises. Just experienced plumbers who treat your home like their own.</p>
      <ul class="dc-why__list">
        <li>Local, family-owned and operated</li>
        <li>25+ years serving Central Ohio</li>
        <li>Upfront pricing before any work begins</li>
        <li>Clean work, no mess left behind</li>
        <li>Available 24/7 for emergencies</li>
        <li>Family owned and operated</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Get a Free Estimate</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TAGLINE BANNER -->
  <section class="tagline-banner">
    <div class="tagline-banner__track">
      <div class="tagline-banner__inner" aria-hidden="true">
        <span>Stop Stressin' &amp; <em>Call Hesson!</em></span>
        <span class="tagline-banner__dot"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/></svg></span>
        <span>Stop Stressin' &amp; <em>Call Hesson!</em></span>
        <span class="tagline-banner__dot"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/></svg></span>
        <span>Stop Stressin' &amp; <em>Call Hesson!</em></span>
        <span class="tagline-banner__dot"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/></svg></span>
        <span>Stop Stressin' &amp; <em>Call Hesson!</em></span>
        <span class="tagline-banner__dot"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/></svg></span>
        <span>Stop Stressin' &amp; <em>Call Hesson!</em></span>
        <span class="tagline-banner__dot"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/></svg></span>
        <span>Stop Stressin' &amp; <em>Call Hesson!</em></span>
        <span class="tagline-banner__dot"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/></svg></span>
        <span>Stop Stressin' &amp; <em>Call Hesson!</em></span>
        <span class="tagline-banner__dot"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/></svg></span>
        <span>Stop Stressin' &amp; <em>Call Hesson!</em></span>
        <span class="tagline-banner__dot"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/></svg></span>
        <span>Stop Stressin' &amp; <em>Call Hesson!</em></span>
        <span class="tagline-banner__dot"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/></svg></span>
        <span>Stop Stressin' &amp; <em>Call Hesson!</em></span>
        <span class="tagline-banner__dot"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/></svg></span>
        <span>Stop Stressin' &amp; <em>Call Hesson!</em></span>
        <span class="tagline-banner__dot"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/></svg></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA BANNER -->
  <section class="dc-cta">
